2Ch 36:1 , Jehoahaz succeeding, is deposed by Pharaoh, and carried into Egypt;
2Ch 36:5 , Jehoiakim reigning ill, is carried bound into Babylon;
2Ch 36:9 , Jehoiachin succeeding, reigns ill, and is brought into Babylon;
2Ch 36:11 , Zedekiah succeeding, reigns ill, despises the prophets, and rebels against Nebuchadnezzar;
2Ch 36:14 , Jerusalem, for the sins of the priests and the people, is wholly destroyed;
2Ch 36:22 , The proclamation of Cyrus.
